# MODULE-001-T111 (2) route probes through `advance start` on H2 (capabilities: every KNOWN_CAPABILITIES entry = secrets, fs, skills, memory, grant, llm, tools, messaging, lifecycle, genui; genui.enabled: true; deployed driver; git repository)
# captured on the pre-lane OSS tree (main 678b7a77 = v0.1.26 + the sign-in retry fix + the workspace version bump after it, plus the read-only ClientApi::route_table accessor), before the runtime-compose move
# native client: loopback, no Origin, x-advance-api-version: 2026-09-17, bearer session;
# GET with no query; POST with body {} (+ idempotency-key for mutations); path params = "golden-probe-id"
# <KEY> -> <status> data <canonical JSON of data, keys sorted> [warnings=[<code> "<message>", …]] | <status> error <code> "<message>" [details=…]
# masked values render as "<NAME>" (PROBE_MASKS in the test); <ROOT> = the temp root; 127.0.0.1:<PORT> = a loopback port
== session
POST /client/session/login -> 200 data {"csrf_token":null,"expires_at":"<SESSION_EXPIRES_AT: now+480min>","platform":"mac","principal":{"id":"operator","os_user":"operator"},"scopes":["read_runs","control_runs","read_messages","send_messages","approve_grants","read_inventory","read_events","read_llm_deltas","write_entities"],"session_id":"<SESSION_ID>","token":"<SESSION_TOKEN>"}
POST /client/session/login (Origin: http://127.0.0.1:<PORT> = the bound console origin) -> 200 data {"csrf_token":"<CSRF_TOKEN>","expires_at":"<SESSION_EXPIRES_AT: now+480min>","platform":"mac","principal":{"id":"operator","os_user":"operator"},"scopes":["read_runs","control_runs","read_messages","send_messages","approve_grants","read_inventory","read_events","read_llm_deltas","write_entities"],"session_id":"<SESSION_ID>","token":"<SESSION_TOKEN>"}
